# https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "1996"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/mexo/SwarmIntelligence> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stochastic constructive search inspired by pheromone-based foraging; solutions are built probabilistically and reinforced by pheromone updates. Reference: Dorigo, M., Maniezzo, V., & Colorni, A. (1996). The ant system: Optimization by a colony of cooperating agents. IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics—Part B, 26(1), 29–41."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ant_colony_optimization_algorithms> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntColonyOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ant Colony Optimization (ACO) / Ant System"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2015"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.advengsoft.2015.01.010> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/mexo/SwarmIntelligence> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Swarm algorithm inspired by antlion hunting; ants perform random walks influenced by antlions (elite solutions). Reference: Mirjalili, S. (2015). The ant lion optimizer. Advances in Engineering Software, 83, 80–98. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.advengsoft.2015.01.010"@en .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/AntLionOptimizer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ant Lion Optimizer (ALO)"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/mexo/ArtificialBeeColony
<https://w3id.org/mexo/ArtificialBeeColony> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/ArtificialBeeColony> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/ArtificialBeeColony> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/ArtificialBeeColony> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2007"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/ArtificialBeeColony> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.1007/s10898-007-9149-x> .
