<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicAlgorithm> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2006"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ecolmodel.2005.07.010> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/mexo/BioInspired> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Plant colonization-inspired algorithm where weeds reproduce and disperse seeds with decreasing variance to intensify search. Reference: Mehrabian, A. R., & Lucas, C. (2006). A novel numerical optimization algorithm inspired from weed colonization. Ecological Modelling, 179(4), 355–366. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ecolmodel.2005.07.010"@en .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/mexo/MetaheuristicTaxonomy> .
<https://w3id.org/mexo/InvasiveWeedOptimization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Invasive Weed Optimization (IWO)"@en .
